  "sentences": [
    {
      "endMs": 10053,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 13,
      "id": 0,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 1000,
      "startWord": 0,
      "text": "Let's start with the set piece, because that is where your teams are known."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 20048,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 27,
      "id": 1,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 11233,
      "startWord": 14,
      "text": "The scrum is a contest of angles before it is a contest of strength."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 29088,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 40,
      "id": 2,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 20608,
      "startWord": 28,
      "text": "If the tight head's shoulder is above his hip the pressure goes nowhere."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 39915,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 56,
      "id": 3,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 29648,
      "startWord": 41,
      "text": "We film every scrum from behind the posts so the players see their own body height."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 48628,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 68,
      "id": 4,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 41095,
      "startWord": 57,
      "text": "How much of that is coachable and how much is simply size?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 57749,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 80,
      "id": 5,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 49808,
      "startWord": 69,
      "text": "Size buys you a margin, but technique is what survives eighty minutes."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 66891,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 93,
      "id": 6,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 58309,
      "startWord": 81,
      "text": "Our lightest prop last season won more penalties than anyone in the league."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 75659,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 106,
      "id": 7,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 67451,
      "startWord": 94,
      "text": "He did it by getting his bind earlier than the man opposite him."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 82789,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 115,
      "id": 8,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 76839,
      "startWord": 107,
      "text": "And the line-out, is that a different skill entirely?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 91740,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 127,
      "id": 9,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 83969,
      "startWord": 116,
      "text": "The line-out is a timing problem dressed up as a jumping problem."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 100746,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 140,
      "id": 10,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 92300,
      "startWord": 128,
      "text": "The lifters have to be moving before the hooker's hands leave the ball."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 109616,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 153,
      "id": 11,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 101306,
      "startWord": 141,
      "text": "We drill the call to the throw in under two seconds, every session."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 116440,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 162,
      "id": 12,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 110796,
      "startWord": 154,
      "text": "Do you change the calls much during a match?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 129436,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 181,
      "id": 13,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 117620,
      "startWord": 163,
      "text": "We carry four and we use two, because a caller who is thinking is a caller who is late."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 138408,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 194,
      "id": 14,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 129996,
      "startWord": 182,
      "text": "The opposition scout our first six line-outs and we know that they do."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 146433,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 206,
      "id": 15,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 138968,
      "startWord": 195,
      "text": "So the sixth one is usually the one we have been saving."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 155588,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 218,
      "id": 16,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 147613,
      "startWord": 207,
      "text": "What about the breakdown, which everyone says is where matches are won?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 163631,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 228,
      "id": 17,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 156768,
      "startWord": 219,
      "text": "The breakdown rewards whoever arrives with their feet already set."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 173278,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 242,
      "id": 18,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 164191,
      "startWord": 229,
      "text": "A player who arrives fast and off balance gives away the penalty every time."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 182721,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 256,
      "id": 19,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 173838,
      "startWord": 243,
      "text": "We coach the last three steps before the ruck, not the sprint into it."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 191031,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 267,
      "id": 20,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 183901,
      "startWord": 257,
      "text": "Is that why your penalty count dropped so sharply last year?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 201536,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 281,
      "id": 21,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 192211,
      "startWord": 268,
      "text": "Partly, and partly because we stopped asking the flankers to compete on every ball."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 210678,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 294,
      "id": 22,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 202096,
      "startWord": 282,
      "text": "Choosing three rucks a half to attack is worth more than contesting thirty."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 219985,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 308,
      "id": 23,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 211238,
      "startWord": 295,
      "text": "The referee starts to trust a pack that is not always on the edge."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 224920,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 314,
      "id": 24,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 221165,
      "startWord": 309,
      "text": "How do you decide which three?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 236231,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 330,
      "id": 25,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 226100,
      "startWord": 315,
      "text": "We look for the ruck after a big carry, when their support is still getting up."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 245033,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 343,
      "id": 26,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 236791,
      "startWord": 331,
      "text": "That is the moment the ball is slowest and the guard is thinnest."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 253466,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 355,
      "id": 27,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 245593,
      "startWord": 344,
      "text": "Everything else we leave alone and get back into the defensive line."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 261470,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 366,
      "id": 28,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 254646,
      "startWord": 356,
      "text": "Does any of this change on a wet night in February?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 267925,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 374,
      "id": 29,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 262650,
      "startWord": 367,
      "text": "The weather changes the reward, not the method."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 278514,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 390,
      "id": 30,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 268485,
      "startWord": 375,
      "text": "In the wet the scrum is worth more because the backs will not run from deep."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 288428,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 405,
      "id": 31,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 279074,
      "startWord": 391,
      "text": "So we shorten the game and make them play in front of their own posts."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 296534,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 416,
      "id": 32,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 289608,
      "startWord": 406,
      "text": "What do you look for when you recruit a young forward?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 306767,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 430,
      "id": 33,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 297714,
      "startWord": 417,
      "text": "Work rate first, because you cannot teach a man to want the next collision."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 316011,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 443,
      "id": 34,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 307327,
      "startWord": 431,
      "text": "Then neck and shoulder strength, because that part takes the longest to build."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 324609,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 456,
      "id": 35,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 316571,
      "startWord": 444,
      "text": "Skills we can add, and we can add them quickly at that age."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 332715,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 467,
      "id": 36,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 325789,
      "startWord": 457,
      "text": "What is the most common mistake you see in club rugby?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 340554,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 477,
      "id": 37,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 333895,
      "startWord": 468,
      "text": "Packs that push straight when they should be pushing across."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 349827,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 491,
      "id": 38,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 341114,
      "startWord": 478,
      "text": "A straight shove against a good front row is a shove into a wall."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 356065,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 500,
      "id": 39,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1950,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 350387,
      "startWord": 492,
      "text": "The angle is free and almost nobody takes it."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 366024,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 512,
      "id": 40,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 358015,
      "startWord": 501,
      "text": "I want to change subject completely, because you also write about money."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 375145,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 524,
      "id": 41,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 367204,
      "startWord": 513,
      "text": "Compound interest is the one idea in finance that everybody agrees on."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 384117,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 537,
      "id": 42,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 375705,
      "startWord": 525,
      "text": "It works because the return itself starts earning a return of its own."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 393157,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 550,
      "id": 43,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 384677,
      "startWord": 538,
      "text": "The first ten years look disappointing and the last ten look like magic."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 400253,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 559,
      "id": 44,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 394337,
      "startWord": 551,
      "text": "Why do people give up during the disappointing part?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 410520,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 573,
      "id": 45,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 401433,
      "startWord": 560,
      "text": "Because the curve is almost flat there, and a flat curve feels like failure."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 420638,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 588,
      "id": 46,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 411080,
      "startWord": 574,
      "text": "A pound saved in the first year is worth many pounds saved in the twentieth."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 428595,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 600,
      "id": 47,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 421198,
      "startWord": 589,
      "text": "But it does not feel that way while you are saving it."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 437546,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 612,
      "id": 48,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 429775,
      "startWord": 601,
      "text": "What do you tell someone starting at forty rather than at twenty?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 445856,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 623,
      "id": 49,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 438726,
      "startWord": 613,
      "text": "That the arithmetic is harsher, but that it is not hopeless."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 456445,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 639,
      "id": 50,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 446416,
      "startWord": 624,
      "text": "They have to save a larger share and they have to leave it alone for longer."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 465247,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 652,
      "id": 51,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 457005,
      "startWord": 640,
      "text": "The mistake is deciding to make up the lost time with extra risk."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 469881,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 657,
      "id": 52,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 466427,
      "startWord": 653,
      "text": "You mean picking individual stocks?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 478089,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 668,
      "id": 53,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 471061,
      "startWord": 658,
      "text": "I mean anything at all that promises to shorten the wait."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 488712,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 684,
      "id": 54,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 478649,
      "startWord": 669,
      "text": "The wait is the product, and the return is what you are paid for enduring it."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 497179,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 696,
      "id": 55,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 489272,
      "startWord": 685,
      "text": "Every scheme that removes the wait puts something worse in its place."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 503362,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 704,
      "id": 56,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 498359,
      "startWord": 697,
      "text": "So a broad index fund and nothing else?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 514032,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 719,
      "id": 57,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 504542,
      "startWord": 705,
      "text": "For almost everybody, a broad index fund at a low fee is the whole answer."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 523208,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 732,
      "id": 58,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 514592,
      "startWord": 720,
      "text": "The fee matters more than people believe, because the fee compounds as well."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 533020,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 747,
      "id": 59,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 523768,
      "startWord": 733,
      "text": "One per cent a year for thirty years is a quarter of the final pot."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 539742,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 756,
      "id": 60,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 534200,
      "startWord": 748,
      "text": "A quarter seems far too large to be true."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 549635,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 770,
      "id": 61,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 540922,
      "startWord": 757,
      "text": "Run the numbers and it is worse than that in a low return decade."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 559719,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 785,
      "id": 62,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 550195,
      "startWord": 771,
      "text": "The fee is charged on the balance, so it grows exactly as your money grows."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 567142,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 795,
      "id": 63,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 560279,
      "startWord": 786,
      "text": "It is compound interest, working very patiently for somebody else."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 574675,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 805,
      "id": 64,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 568322,
      "startWord": 796,
      "text": "What about timing the market at all, even a little?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 584976,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 819,
      "id": 65,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 575855,
      "startWord": 806,
      "text": "The evidence is that missing the best twenty days ruins a thirty year record."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 595565,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 835,
      "id": 66,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 585536,
      "startWord": 820,
      "text": "And the best days sit right next to the worst days, which is the cruel part."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 602648,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 845,
      "id": 67,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 596125,
      "startWord": 836,
      "text": "You cannot avoid the one without also missing the other."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 608326,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 852,
      "id": 68,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 603828,
      "startWord": 846,
      "text": "Do you rebalance the portfolio at all?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 618015,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 866,
      "id": 69,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 609506,
      "startWord": 853,
      "text": "Once a year, on a date I picked in advance and do not move."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 629381,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 883,
      "id": 70,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 618575,
      "startWord": 867,
      "text": "The date matters far less than the fact that I did not choose it while watching news."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 641791,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 902,
      "id": 71,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 629941,
      "startWord": 884,
      "text": "A rule you wrote when you were calm is worth more than a decision made when you are not."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 649494,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 912,
      "id": 72,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 642971,
      "startWord": 903,
      "text": "Is there anything here you have changed your mind about?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 658309,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 924,
      "id": 73,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 650674,
      "startWord": 913,
      "text": "I used to think an emergency fund of three months was enough."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 668864,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 940,
      "id": 74,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 658869,
      "startWord": 925,
      "text": "I now think six, because its real job is to stop you selling at the bottom."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 678613,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 954,
      "id": 75,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 669424,
      "startWord": 941,
      "text": "It is not really a savings account, it is insurance against your own behaviour."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 685437,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 963,
      "id": 76,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 1180,
      "question": true,
      "speaker": "0",
      "startMs": 679793,
      "startWord": 955,
      "text": "What would you tell a twenty year old today?"
    },
    {
      "endMs": 695165,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 976,
      "id": 77,
      "opensTurn": true,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 686617,
      "startWord": 964,
      "text": "Automate it, keep the fee low, then go and spend your attention elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 701908,
      "endsTurn": false,
      "endWord": 986,
      "id": 78,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 560,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 695725,
      "startWord": 977,
      "text": "The plan does not need you once it is running."
    },
    {
      "endMs": 708282,
      "endsTurn": true,
      "endWord": 995,
      "id": 79,
      "opensTurn": false,
      "pauseAfterMs": 0,
      "question": false,
      "speaker": "1",
      "startMs": 702468,
      "startWord": 987,
      "text": "Watching it will only tempt you into breaking it."
    }
  ]
}
